{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"185178a5e7cd62280fa798f14a56447819458fbb91f8b4e70a1ff21df5223e11"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:b119d53372b8c96d0ccb1cd0ca1503235fc7d06f49ebb2ac4af1762384f85fcc","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Seattle","evidence":"[D3:19 | 4:21 pm on 16 July, 2023] John: It's Seattle, I'm stoked for my game there next month! It's one of my favorite cities to explore - super vibrant!\n[D5:2 | 10:29 am on 9 August, 2023] John: Hi Tim! Nice to hear from you. Glad you could reconnect. As for me, lots of stuff happened since we last talked. Last week I had a crazy game - crazy intense! We won it by a tight score. Scoring that last basket and hearing the crowd cheer was awesome!\n[D6:1 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Hey Tim, sorry I missed you. Been a crazy few days. Took a trip to a new place - it's been amazing. Love the energy there.\n[D6:3 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: I was in Chicago, it was awesome! It had so much energy and the locals were really friendly. It's great to experience other cultures and connect with new folks.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5ac9794a-9e89-5d8c-82ed-4f69aad9565a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:34fc971acfc2e0f093db62c035b71610c137f898e38083fe7c43e4399324baf1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which city was John in before traveling to Chicago?","referenceAnswer":"Seattle","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"34fc971acfc2e0f093db62c035b71610c137f898e38083fe7c43e4399324baf1"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}